	(text "YX8018 TO-94 pinout (datasheet Ver2.1, Table 1):\n  1 LX   power switch drain -> L and LED anode\n  2 GND  battery -\n  3 CE   solar cell - : enable (dark = on) + charge return\n  4 VCC  battery + AND solar cell + (shared rail)\n\nDay:   lit panel pulls CE below GND, chip off, battery charges\n       through the internal CE-GND switch.\nNight: internal 37k pull-up lifts CE to VCC, oscillator runs,\n       L dumps into D1. The LED is the rectifier - no diode.\nL sets the LED current: 220uH=5.8mA, 82uH=14.8mA, 22uH=51.4mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 63.5 120.65 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6c3c3c03-0003-4003-8003-000000000001")
	)
